      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Tought I do agree that a better anti-cheat could have been aded, VAC would have been a comepletely useless solution in comparison as it doesn't seem to have been able to stop any sort of cheats or bots in alot oft he games that use it. Case being TF2's bot crisis that lasted a little over two years and only got fixed recently.",
